Alembic migrations for tcsh-ar-api.

Common commands:

    # create a new migration from current models
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "short description"

    # apply all pending migrations
    uv run alembic upgrade head

    # roll back one
    uv run alembic downgrade -1

env.py is adapted for SQLAlchemy 2.0 async + asyncpg. Whenever a new domain
module is added under src/tcsh_ar_api/<module>/models.py, append the
corresponding `import` line in env.py so autogenerate sees the models.
